    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Inscr.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> Inscr.</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="Abt Inscr." corresp="#wit-h">þis syndon þa domas, þe Æðelbirht cyning asette on Agustinus dæge.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">Ðis syndon þa domas þe Æðelbirht cyning asette on AGustinus dæge</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">These are the decrees which King Æthelberht set in Augustine’s time.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">These are the decrees which King Æthelberht established in the lifetime of Augustine.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Dies sind die Gesetze, die König Aethelbirht festsetzte zu Augustins Lebzeiten.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">These are the laws which King Æthelberht established in Augustine’s lifetime.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
